<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n42321" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐρετ-μόω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>furnish with oars, set to row,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χέρας</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>Med.</u>
					4
				</span></i>
			 ; but <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χεῖρας ἐ.</span>
			<i>lay</i> their hands <i>to the oar,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Orph.
				<u>A.</u>
				358
			</span></i> ; <i>use</i> their hands <i>as oars, swim,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Nonn.
				<u>D.</u>
				7.185
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐ. πορείην</span>
			<i>pursue</i> a course, ib.<i><span class="en">
				33.191
			</span></i>, al. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<i>traverse</i> as if with oars, ib.<i><span class="en">
				14.4
			</span></i>:—
				Pass.
			, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀὴρ ἐρετμώθη
			πτερύγεσσιν</span> ib.<i><span class="en">
				6.388
			</span></i>.</div>
